      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{62df03d57b690f44bb954f28|full_name} I think the problem is twofold:\n\n1. The broom, as it stands, is pretty, er, aggressive in the kind of flight it enables. So even in worlds where the creator wishes to allow it, it can be a bit of a nuisance.\n\n2. Disabling movement-modifying props applies to all props. Not just \"that one annoying prop\".\n\nNot only that but it seems *VRChat's* intent is releasing a fun seasonal gimmick. My suggestion is for a way we could keep the flying broom, whilst having true flight locked to just one month.",
