      "value": "> *\"It’s not aggressive it’s a perfect speed and height as is.\"*\n\n@{6ac4eeeeb987445a69d5e589|full_name} I extremely beg to differ. I play seated and the thing, once it *takes off* seems to send me flying in some worlds.\n\nNot all worlds, strangely. But I'm surely not the only one who thinks its a little fast and high flying. It's not very elegant, to say none the least.\n\n> *\"So what if they have to disable props? It’s not that big of a deal. Prop aren’t even used that much to begin with, so it’s not really a huge sacrifice to turn them off if necessary.\"*\n\nEvery group instance and friends instance Ive been in, with multiple groups, props are out all the time.\n\nBeing said, **what I was suggesting was just a potential alternative** *if* **VRCHAT is concerned about letting players fly around at high speed all the time.** Big if. Call it \"covering bases\".",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
